# Blue KAS wrapper

Use this wrapper only as a profile-local discovery and composition entrypoint.
It points to the official KAS plugin base and project overlays; it is not a
copy of the base KAS skill pack.

When KAS phase guidance is needed, load the plugin base by qualified name:

```text
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:<base>")
```

Role manifest: `kkachi-agent-skills:roles/blue.yaml`

Allowed base subset: the Blue commander role may use the full source-controlled
KAS base subset declared by the role manifest. Do not infer additional
authority from the profile name.

Overlay lookup:

```text
skills/<project>/kas-overlays/<project>-blue-<base-skill>-overlay/SKILL.md
```

For overlay authoring or composition details, load:

```text
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-project-overlay-guide")
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-overlay-compose-guide")
skill_view("kkachi-agent-skills:kas-overlay-doctor-guide")
```

If the plugin base, role manifest, or overlay target is missing: stop, report
the exact missing surface, do not use profile-local copied skills as fallback,
and request review or approval.

This wrapper does not authorize profile cleanup, wrapper rollout, KAH/KAB
mutation, runtime/provider/model changes, copied-suite migration, or base-body
replacement.
